  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup chopped walnuts",
    "1 (18.25 ounce) package yellow cake mix",
    "1 (3.4 ounce) package instant vanilla pudding mix",
    "4 eggs",
    "1 cup dark rum, divided",
    "0.75 cup water, divided",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eaFccpaVQpEFTPYXFjF3kGVUGqE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17456-Golden-Rum-Cake-ddmfs-step-0-246-36f72a4f8a8049838f58a341105c7272.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17456/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease and flour a 10-inch Bundt pan. Sprinkle chopped walnuts evenly over the bottom of the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H984aPt4OxXCoykOQ6s82MJ0vrU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17456-Golden-Rum-Cake-ddmfs-step-2-249-2a8d2a91a87e4db08af7cb896e677000.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17456/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cake mix and pudding mix in a large bowl. Whisk in eggs, 1/2 cup rum, 1/2 cup water, and oil until smooth and well-blended. Pour cake batter over chopped nuts in the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iNaWrRPh7zsAnUx4gs0jppcamS8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17456-Golden-Rum-Cake-ddmfs-step-4-251-ea7c5da43f9b40cb8a8ecb73b2632a3d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17456/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into cake comes out clean, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6-3x1t7gUMTlxTzfZXvbuTcTy0I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17456-Golden-Rum-Cake-ddmfs-step-5-267-d63b8c8719a74a578f51ed488938fba1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17456/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the glaze: Combine sugar, butter, and remaining 1/4 cup water in a saucepan. Bring to a boil over medium heat; cook, stirring constantly, until it thickens and slightly darkens, about 5 minutes. Remove from heat and stir in remaining 1/2 cup rum.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h67g5eaCfGPgKVJbB-SRmeYiZDo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17456-Golden-Rum-Cake-ddmfs-step-7-257-b4dfa482a6004ce9b4f678c6733fef49.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17456/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool cake in pan for 10 minutes before inverting onto a serving plate. Brush glaze over top and sides of warm cake, allowing glaze to soak in. Repeat until all glaze is used.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/544kOviBiPX9zgOLXCRTrMsFQJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17456-Golden-Rum-Cake-ddmfs-step-8-303-a6e04c6fd79d4dc7902b4d8735a0fa61.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17456/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nCV8f_tXyIsWok1jQlCj1zzOv_I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17456-Golden-Rum-Cake-ddmfs-4x3-314-881d5ebe590045ab9d3cee51857675f9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17456/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
